@* The single reusable Course Completion Certificate document body — used both for the always-visible
   preview on /kurs/finalen-izpit (blank personal fields, no controls) and for the real issued
   certificate once a learner has typed their name. Keeping exactly one copy of this markup is what
   stops the preview and the real certificate from ever drifting apart visually. Deliberately contains
   no button/control of its own — "Създай удостоверение"/print live in the caller, wrapped only around
   the real issued instance, never around the preview. Null LearnerName/IssueDate render a plain blank
   placeholder line, never a fictional name or today's date — the preview's own contract. *@
<div class="course-certificate">
    <p class="course-certificate__issuer">CBT Learning Platform</p>
    <h3 class="course-certificate__title">Удостоверение за успешно завършен курс</h3>
    <p class="course-certificate__name">@(string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(LearnerName) ? "________________________" : LearnerName)</p>
    <p class="course-certificate__course">15-седмичен курс по когнитивно-поведенческа терапия</p>
    <p class="course-certificate__statement">Курсът е успешно завършен.</p>
    <p class="course-certificate__date">Дата на издаване: @(IssueDate is null ? "__________" : IssueDate.Value.ToString("dd.MM.yyyy"))</p>
    <p class="course-certificate__disclaimer">
        Този документ удостоверява завършване на образователния курс. Не представлява
        професионална квалификация, лиценз, акредитация или право за упражняване на
        психотерапевтична практика.
    </p>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public string? LearnerName { get; set; }

    [Parameter]
    public DateTime? IssueDate { get; set; }
}
